      <text:p text:style-name="PageStart">[공통] 서식 2</text:p>
      <text:p text:style-name="Title">개인정보 수집 · 이용 동의서</text:p>
      <text:p>※ 공모 신청자(대표자)가 팀원 전원의 개인정보 수집·이용 동의서를 각각 작성하여 제출</text:p>
      <table:table table:name="PrivacyForm" table:style-name="FormTable">
        <table:table-column table:style-name="Col"/><table:table-column table:style-name="Col"/><table:table-column table:style-name="Col"/><table:table-column table:style-name="Col"/>
        <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label"><text:p>성 명</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"/><table:table-cell table:style-name="Label"><text:p>생년월일</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"/></table:table-row>
